@page "/components/switch"

<PageTitle>Switch — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Switch</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    The same input as Checkbox, presented as a state that is on or off rather than ticked.
    <code>role="switch"</code> is what tells a screen reader the difference — without it this is a
    checkbox that merely looks unusual.
</p>

